Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,H_ms,,0,0,0,,"Umpis. Awak pijak PERIT DARAH saya." Dia datang nak batalkan pertunangan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.84,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hari ni, DIA berani batalkan pertunangan dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.90,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Umpis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak pijak perit darah saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.82,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.93,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.98,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hari ni saya datang nak batalkan pertunangan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.37,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Keluarga Yun pilih awak sebab awak orang berilmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.77,S_ms,,0,0,0,,dan terpaksa terima jodoh ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.71,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.81,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Miskin sampai rebus batu nak makan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:16.97,S_ms,,0,0,0,,tapi gali kubur sendiri kat sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.91,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau orang tahu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.09,S_ms,,0,0,0,,maruah keluarga Yun hancur sebab awak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.03,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Memang betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.01,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Katak bermimpi makan daging angsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.33,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Orang miskin macam awak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.41,S_ms,,0,0,0,,tak layak untuk permata seperti Yun Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:26.72,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Pak cik,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.20,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kenapa marah pada sampah macam ni?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.24,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Boleh kotor tangan awak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dalam dingin macam ni,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.80,S_ms,,0,0,0,,hanya istana saya di bandar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.00,S_ms,,0,0,0,,yang boleh beri kehangatan sebenar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.16,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ruang bawah tanah keluarga Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.40,S_ms,,0,0,0,,penuh dengan arang untuk sepanjang musim sejuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.40,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Pindah masuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.44,S_ms,,0,0,0,,walau langit runtuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.04,S_ms,,0,0,0,,satu jaripun awak tak akan beku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.70,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Lepas kertas kahwin tu sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.86,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Lepas tu korang boleh beredar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Apa yang awak kata?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.72,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya kata
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.90,S_ms,,0,0,0,,lepas kertas kahwin tu sini.
